# Sky lantern guestbook — optional.
#
# Leave these unset and the guestbook still works: messages are kept in the
# visitor's own browser (localStorage) instead of being shared. Set them and
# every visitor sees every other visitor's lantern.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` for local development, and add the same two values
# in Vercel under Settings -> Environment Variables. Setup steps are in the
# README, under "The sky lantern guestbook".
#
# The anon key is designed to be public — it ends up in the JavaScript bundle
# either way. What keeps the table safe is the row-level security policy, not
# the secrecy of this value. Never put the *service_role* key here.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
